OL,3,GNEWSAMotorhead guitarist Phil Campbell
OL,4,Adied from multi-organ failure, inquest
OL,5,Ahears
OL,6,
OL,7,FMotorhead guitarist Phil Campbell died
OL,8,Ffrom multi-organ failure after
OL,9,Fsuffering complications following
OL,10,F"necessary" surgeries, an inquest has
OL,11,Fheard.
OL,13,FThe Welsh rock star, who was the band's
OL,14,Fguitarist from 1984 until it disbanded
OL,15,Fin 2015, died aged 64 on 13 March.
OL,17,FCampbell's death could not have been
OL,18,Fprevented, St Pancras Coroner's Court
OL,19,Fheard on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
